    "title": "Alabama vs Hofstra schedule, TV channel, how to watch March Madness",
    "text": "Updated March 17, 2026, 3:37 p.m. MTAlabama and Hofstra play in a March Madness NCAA Tournament men's college basketball game on Friday, March 20.Here's what to know about the time, TV channel, streaming information and announcers for the Midwest Region March Madness first-round game.Alabama is the No. 4 seed in the region.Hofstra is the No. 13 seed.The winner of this game will take on No. 5 Texas Tech or No. 12 Akron in the second round of the NCAA Tournament on Sunday, March 22.How to watch March Madness: Ohio State-TCU | Nebraska-Troy | Louisville-South Florida | Wisconsin-High Point | Duke-Siena | Vanderbilt-McNeese | Michigan State-North Dakota State | Arkansas-Hawaii | North Carolina-VCU | Saint Mary's-Texas A&M | Illinois-Penn | Georgia-Saint Louis | Gonzaga-Kennesaw State | Houston-Idaho | Kentucky-Santa Clara | Texas Tech-Akron | Arizona-Long Island | Virginia-Wright State | Iowa State-Tennessee State | Alabama-Hofstra | Villanova-Utah State | Clemson-Iowa | St. John's-UNI | UCLA-UCF | Purdue-Queens | Kansas-Cal Baptist | UConn-Furman | Miami-Missouri | Schedule | TV channels | AnnouncersWatch Alabama vs Hofstra on Sling TVWhat time is the Alabama vs Hofstra March Madness game?The Hofstra vs Alabama NCAA Tournament first-round game is scheduled for 12:15 p.m. MST on Friday, March 20.March Madness picks: Ohio State-TCU | Nebraska-Troy | Louisville-South Florida | Wisconsin-High Point | Duke-Siena | Vanderbilt-McNeese | Michigan State-North Dakota State | Arkansas-Hawaii | North Carolina-VCU | Saint Mary's-Texas A&M | Illinois-Penn | Georgia-Saint Louis | Gonzaga-Kennesaw State | Houston-Idaho | Kentucky-Santa Clara | Texas Tech-Akron | Arizona-Long Island | Virginia-Wright State | Iowa State-Tennessee State | Alabama-Hofstra | Villanova-Utah State | Clemson-Iowa | St. John's-UNI | UCLA-UCF | Purdue-Queens | Kansas-Cal Baptist | UConn-Furman | Miami-Missouri | The Republic's score predictionsWhat channel is the Hofstra vs Alabama March Madness game on?The Alabama vs Hofstra first-round NCAA Tournament game can be seen on truTV.Join the madness: USA TODAY Bracket Challenge | Survivor Pool | Printable bracket | Your picks vs expertsHow can I stream the Alabama vs Hofstra March Madness game?Hofstra vs Alabama can be streamed on Sling TV and other streaming services that carry truTV.Who are the announcers for the Hofstra vs Alabama March Madness game?Tom McCarthy will have the play-by-play call of the Alabama Crimson Tide vs Hofstra Pride NCAA Tournament game, with Candace Parker and Dan Bonner as the analysts and AJ Ross as the reporter for the March Madness first-round matchup.March Madness odds: Ohio State-TCU | Nebraska-Troy | Louisville-South Florida | Wisconsin-High Point | Duke-Siena | Vanderbilt-McNeese | Michigan State-North Dakota State | Arkansas-Hawaii | North Carolina-VCU | Saint Mary's-Texas A&M | Illinois-Penn | Georgia-Saint Louis | Gonzaga-Kennesaw State | Houston-Idaho | Kentucky-Santa Clara | Texas Tech-Akron | Arizona-Long Island | Virginia-Wright State | Iowa State-Tennessee State | Alabama-Hofstra | Villanova-Utah State | Clemson-Iowa | St. John's-UNI | UCLA-UCF | Purdue-Queens | Kansas-Cal Baptist | UConn-Furman | Miami-Missouri | Betting odds | Title oddsReach Jeremy Cluff at jeremy.cluff@arizonarepublic.com. Follow him on X, formerly Twitter @Jeremy_Cluff.Support local journalism: Subscribe to azcentral.com today. Sign up for azcentral Preps Now. And be sure to subscribe to our daily sports newsletters so you don't miss a thing.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
